<title>VENEZUELA: Clinton confrims visit Venezuela in October.</title>
<headline>Clinton confrims visit Venezuela in October.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. President Bill Clinton has confirmed he will visit Venezuela Oct. 17, Venezuelan information minister Fernando Egana said Wednesday.</p>
<p>A trip originally scheduled for May was canceled after Clinton injured his knee.</p>
